1 REM FBCS SEG-0529
2 REM CLAIM A-9.2.2-TR137
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 9.2.2 l.4522-4526, 12.1.4 l.8805-8807: the detached-handler of an EXTERNAL picture calls the external SUB that the
5 REM picture declares.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE P
20 DRAW P
30 END
100 EXTERNAL PICTURE P
110 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB LOG
120 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
130   CAUSE EXCEPTION 7
140 END WHEN
150 HANDLER H
160   CALL LOG(EXTYPE)
170 END HANDLER
180 END PICTURE
300 EXTERNAL SUB LOG(T)
310 PRINT "LOG"; T
320 END SUB
